#: 432hz-player
msgctxt "432hz-player"
msgid ""
"Most music is recorded in 440hz. Many people claim that  432hz resonates more with the heart whereas 440hz resonates  more with the brain, and that 432hz music feels better. Try  it yourself. Play a music in 440hz and in 432hz, and see  which one you prefer. Most people choose the 432hz version,  and it's hard to go back to 440hz.\n"
" \n"
" This application uses a very high-quality pitch-shifting  algorithm with low CPU usage."
msgstr ""

